EO:160,40,,brave_api,number_phrase,Executive Order No. 160 | Supra Source,https://source.gosupra.com/docs/statute/12808/executive-order-160,,number_named,,,,2026-11-12T03:27:38Z,"Eight (8) members of the Board shall constitute a quorum and no action shall be considered as a decision of the Board unless it carries the affirmative vote of at least eight (8) members present and voting. The members of the Board who are government officials shall serve without additional compensation."" ... All laws, orders, issuances, rules and regulations or parts thereof inconsistent with this Executive Order are hereby repealed or modified accordingly."
