EO:195,50,60,internet_archive,number_phrase,"COVID-19 Executive Order Update as of Feb. 26, 2021",https://archive.org/details/tochnc-COVID-19_Executive_Order_Update_as_of_Feb._26_2021,2021-02-26T00:00:00Z,number_named|document_url|official_or_library_host,number_named|order_wording|document_url|official_or_library_host,"Earlier that day, Governor Roy Cooper announced a loosening of COVID-19 restrictions outlined in Executive Order No. 195.",7e0354b63d9d50aa67c900ab49a2326526696fb513490aa6155e3ea4710b77e9,2026-11-12T03:23:27Z,"Emergency Management Coordinator Kelly Drayton updated the Chapel Hill Town Council on Wednesday, Feb. 24. Earlier that day, Governor Roy Cooper announced a loosening of COVID-19 restrictions outlined in Executive Order No. 195. To see the full presentation to the Council on the Town's response to COVID-19, visit http://chapelhill.granicus.com/MediaPlayer.php?view_id=7&clip_id=4681&meta_id=241750."
