EO:1995,5,,federal_register_api,number_phrase,Proposed Interim Approval of the Operating Permits Program; Michigan,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/1996/06/24/96-15886/proposed-interim-approval-of-the-operating-permits-program-michigan,1996-06-24,official_or_library_host,,,,2026-11-12T03:10:23Z,"The EPA proposes interim approval of the Operating Permits Program submitted by the State of Michigan for the purpose of complying with Federal requirements for an approvable State program to issue operating permits to all major stationary sources, and to certain other sources, with the exception of sources on Indian lands."
