EO:305,40,,brave_api,number_phrase,N.J. Admin. Code Executive Order No. 305 (2022) - Executive Order No. 305 (2022) | State Regulations | US Law | LII / Legal Information Institute,https://www.law.cornell.edu/regulations/new-jersey/N-J-Admin-Code-Executive-Order-No-305-(2022),,number_named,,,,2026-11-12T03:14:16Z,"The Advisory Council is authorized to call upon any Executive Branch department or agency to supply it with information or other assistance available to such agency as the Advisory Council determines to be necessary to discharge its duties under this Order. Each Executive Branch department and agency is hereby required, to the extent not inconsistent with law, to cooperate fully with the Advisory Council and to furnish such assistance on as timely a basis as is necessary to accomplish the purpose of this Order."
