EO:830,40,,brave_api,number_phrase,"EXECUTIVE ORDER NO. 830 - DIRECTING THE BUREAU OF IMMIGRATION AND DEPORTATION, PHILIPPINE NATIONAL POLICE, BUREAU OF CUSTOMS AND DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH IN COORDINATION WITH THE CIVIL AVIATION AUTHORITY OF THE PHILIPPINES FOR THE ESTABLISHMENT OF PERMANENT OFFICES AND PERSONNEL COMPLEMENT AT THE KALIBO INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT - Supreme Court E-Library",https://elibrary.judiciary.gov.ph/thebookshelf/showdocs/5/62255,,number_named,,,,2026-11-12T03:21:56Z,SECTION 2. Implementation Period – The establishment of permanent offices and complement of the herein named agencies at the Kalibo International Airport must be completed not later than forty five (45) calendar days from the date of signing of this Order.
