EO:90,40,,brave_api,number_phrase,"EXECUTIVE ORDER NO. 90 - TRANSFERRING THE ATTACHMENT OF, AND REORGANIZING THE PRESIDENTIAL LEGISLATIVE LIAISON OFFICE - Supreme Court E-Library",https://elibrary.judiciary.gov.ph/thebookshelf/showdocs/5/99421,,number_named,,,,2026-11-12T03:36:36Z,"NOW, THEREFORE, I, FERDINAND R. MARCOS, JR., President of the Philippines, by virtue of the powers vested in me by the Constitution and existing laws, do hereby order: Section 1. Reorganization. The Presidential Legislative Liaison Office shall be under the supervision and control of the Office of the Executive Secretary as one of the delivery units of the OP Proper."
